;
; A space this node is in or joining, in MYRA (meadow_rules.h MR5): its
; place in pspace.list (8 at most, vna_space.h VNA_SPACE_MAX), its phase
; (1 searching, 2 joining, 3 in, 4 not found), its members (33 at most),
; the last event index Meadow has read there (zxvd's index, 18 digits)
; and when that event was made, in ms since 1970 (13 digits). Meadow keeps
; a joined space only when its values make a record.
^ZXMEADOW(space:i1) = phase:i1! ^ members:i2! ^ last:i18! ^ stamp:i13!
